This project focuses on retrieving protein sequence and annotation data from the UniProt database. Five protein entries were selected, and for each entry, the following files were downloaded:

UniProt Text Format (.txt)
FASTA Sequence File (.fasta)
XML Format (.xml)

A brief summary containing protein information, organism details, UniProt accession IDs, protein functions, and cellular locations is also included.

Objectives
Learn how to retrieve biological information from UniProt.
Understand protein sequence and functional annotation data.
Work with different biological file formats.
Explore protein functions, organisms, and cellular localization.
Organize bioinformatics datasets for analysis and documentation.
Data Source

All protein entries were retrieved from the UniProt Knowledgebase (UniProtKB).

Website:

https://www.uniprot.org/
